Not included at all
--------------------

Device-specific data — any readback of a real device's flash contents,
any file under a `private/` directory, Bluetooth link keys, device serial
numbers, or any other personal-device identifier — is not included in
this repository and was never part of any export from the original
project repository that produced this one. The `.gitignore` patterns for
`build/hook/*_readback.dfu`, `build/hook/*_flash.log`, `firmware/`,
`adk/`, and `private/` are the main guard against ever accidentally
committing such data in the future; if you fork or contribute to this
repository, do not loosen or remove them.
